            "text": "def momentScale (c : Parameters) (i : Fin 2) : ℝ :=\n  if i = 0 then Real.exp c.pulseStart * pulseAmplitude c\n  else Real.sqrt 2 * Real.exp (3 * c.pulseStart / 2) * pulseAmplitude c ^ 2"
